OL,4,CExplosion on Russian ship            W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GAn explosion has occurred on a       W5
OL,7,GRussian ship docked at Benghazi      W5
OL,8,Gnaval base port after a suspected    W5
OL,9,Gdrone attack, Libya's eastern        W5
OL,10,Ggovernment has said.                 W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GThe explosion happened at dawn on    W5
OL,13,GSunday, while the ship had stopped   W5
OL,14,Gfor fuel and supplies on its way     W5
OL,15,Gback to Russia, Libyan state media   W5
OL,16,Greported, citing the eastern         W5
OL,17,Ggovernment.                          W5
OL,18,                                      W5
OL,19,GIt added that the site was secured,  W5
OL,20,Gand there were no casualties. Moscow W5
OL,21,Ghas yet to comment.                  W5
